	(text "ESTOP chain (0003 4.6): the bank drives J_C 22 with its loop supply; JP2 returns it to J_C 23, which the 2.2k + opto LED senses.\nILOCK chain: J_C 24 -> JP3 -> J_C 25 -> 2.2k -> opto LED.  JP4 / JP5 (open) can feed a loop from +24V_F through 2.2k instead.\nPOS/STOPPED/AT_HOME/END/JUDGE/CLEAR/STOP_LATCH are 24 V logic outputs of the bank, referenced to GND_F (J_C 28-33)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 600 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4986a585-25d5-54ea-a418-03ff0534c5d3")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
